&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be working on the Web Platform team that is responsible for the content management architecture at SmartAsset. This team is building the future content management systems to create, serve, and innovate on the financial information that attracts our users and has built our brand. Your role on this team will involve working on both front and backend services as we build and migrate our new content management system while working closely with senior engineers and architects to design the future of how we serve content.&lt;/p&gt;
